@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `il-interpretation-time`
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g2-validity`
IMPORT `g2-second-schedule`
IMPORT `g2-conditions`
IMPORT `g2-temporary-licence`

-- g2-tests-fixtures.l4: named cases (people, applicants, applications, licences, experts) used by the g2- test modules.
-- No assertion is made here.  Every figure and date is an illustration chosen by the test author; none is a fact of
-- the Law.  The Law's own figures appear only in the assertions, each with the provision that gives it.

§ `Fixtures — people, records and applicants`

GIVETH A Person
`the test person` MEANS
    Person WITH
        `reference for the person` IS "test-person-1"
        `kind of person` IS `an individual`

GIVETH A `Record of offences`
`a clean record` MEANS
    `Record of offences` WITH
        `convicted of a criminal offence` IS FALSE
        `convicted of a disciplinary offence` IS FALSE
        `charged with a criminal offence and no final judgment yet` IS FALSE
        `a disciplinary complaint is pending with no final judgment` IS FALSE

GIVEN convicted IS A BOOLEAN
      charged IS A BOOLEAN
      `disciplinary` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Record of offences`
`a record showing criminal conviction` convicted `criminal charge pending` charged `and disciplinary conviction` `disciplinary` MEANS
    `Record of offences` WITH
        `convicted of a criminal offence` IS convicted
        `convicted of a disciplinary offence` IS `disciplinary`
        `charged with a criminal offence and no final judgment yet` IS charged
        `a disciplinary complaint is pending with no final judgment` IS FALSE

GIVEN first IS A DATE
      last IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Period of work on cooling systems`
`a period of work from` first `to` last MEANS
    `Period of work on cooling systems` WITH
        `first day of the period` IS first
        `last day of the period` IS last

-- An applicant: an adult, a citizen and a resident with a clean record; what varies is what they hold.
GIVEN certificates IS A LIST OF Certificate
      licences IS A LIST OF Licence
      technician IS A BOOLEAN
      engineer IS A BOOLEAN
      programme IS A BOOLEAN
      mechanical IS A BOOLEAN
      periods IS A LIST OF `Period of work on cooling systems`
GIVETH AN Applicant
`an applicant holding` certificates `and licences` licences `, registered as technician` technician `, as practical engineer` engineer `, with the programme completed` programme `, as mechanical engineer` mechanical `, with periods of work` periods MEANS
    Applicant WITH
        `the person` IS `the test person`
        `of full age` IS TRUE
        `an Israeli citizen` IS TRUE
        `an Israeli resident` IS TRUE
        `record of offences` IS `a clean record`
        `licences held` IS licences
        `certificates held` IS certificates
        `registered as a certified technician in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS technician
        `registered as a certified practical engineer in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS engineer
        `completed a study programme that includes the complement course` IS programme
        `registered as an engineer in the mechanical branch` IS mechanical
        `periods of work on cooling systems` IS periods
        `holds a valid electrician licence of a kind listed in the Electricity Regulations` IS FALSE
        `holds a valid working-at-height approval` IS FALSE

GIVEN certificates IS A LIST OF Certificate
GIVETH AN Applicant
`an applicant holding only` certificates MEANS
    `an applicant holding` certificates `and licences` EMPTY `, registered as technician` FALSE `, as practical engineer` FALSE `, with the programme completed` FALSE `, as mechanical engineer` FALSE `, with periods of work` EMPTY

GIVEN periods IS A LIST OF `Period of work on cooling systems`
GIVETH AN Applicant
`an applicant with only the periods of work` periods MEANS
    `an applicant holding` EMPTY `and licences` EMPTY `, registered as technician` FALSE `, as practical engineer` FALSE `, with the programme completed` FALSE `, as mechanical engineer` FALSE `, with periods of work` periods

GIVEN licences IS A LIST OF Licence
GIVETH AN Applicant
`an applicant holding only the licences` licences MEANS
    `an applicant holding` EMPTY `and licences` licences `, registered as technician` FALSE `, as practical engineer` FALSE `, with the programme completed` FALSE `, as mechanical engineer` FALSE `, with periods of work` EMPTY

GIVETH AN Applicant
`an applicant with nothing` MEANS
    `an applicant holding` EMPTY `and licences` EMPTY `, registered as technician` FALSE `, as practical engineer` FALSE `, with the programme completed` FALSE `, as mechanical engineer` FALSE `, with periods of work` EMPTY

GIVEN technician IS A BOOLEAN
      programme IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN Applicant
`an applicant registered as a technician, programme completed being` technician programme MEANS
    `an applicant holding` EMPTY `and licences` EMPTY `, registered as technician` technician `, as practical engineer` FALSE `, with the programme completed` programme `, as mechanical engineer` FALSE `, with periods of work` EMPTY

GIVEN engineer IS A BOOLEAN
      programme IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN Applicant
`an applicant registered as a practical engineer, programme completed being` engineer programme MEANS
    `an applicant holding` EMPTY `and licences` EMPTY `, registered as technician` FALSE `, as practical engineer` engineer `, with the programme completed` programme `, as mechanical engineer` FALSE `, with periods of work` EMPTY

GIVETH AN Applicant
`an applicant registered as a mechanical engineer` MEANS
    `an applicant holding` EMPTY `and licences` EMPTY `, registered as technician` FALSE `, as practical engineer` FALSE `, with the programme completed` FALSE `, as mechanical engineer` TRUE `, with periods of work` EMPTY

-- An applicant whose personal facts vary (the rest as in an applicant with nothing): for tests of s 6(a)(1) to (3).
GIVEN adult IS A BOOLEAN
      citizen IS A BOOLEAN
      resident IS A BOOLEAN
      record IS A `Record of offences`
GIVETH AN Applicant
`an applicant who is adult` adult `, citizen` citizen `, resident` resident `, with the record` record MEANS
    Applicant WITH
        `the person` IS `the test person`
        `of full age` IS adult
        `an Israeli citizen` IS citizen
        `an Israeli resident` IS resident
        `record of offences` IS record
        `licences held` IS EMPTY
        `certificates held` IS EMPTY
        `registered as a certified technician in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS FALSE
        `registered as a certified practical engineer in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS FALSE
        `completed a study programme that includes the complement course` IS FALSE
        `registered as an engineer in the mechanical branch` IS FALSE
        `periods of work on cooling systems` IS EMPTY
        `holds a valid electrician licence of a kind listed in the Electricity Regulations` IS FALSE
        `holds a valid working-at-height approval` IS FALSE

§ `Fixtures — applications`

GIVEN kind IS A `Licence kind`
      applicant IS AN Applicant
      day IS A DATE
GIVETH AN Application
`an application for a` kind `by` applicant `made on` day MEANS
    Application WITH
        `the applicant` IS applicant
        `the kind of licence sought` IS kind
        `an application to renew` IS FALSE
        `an application for a temporary licence` IS FALSE
        `the day of the application` IS day

-- The day the test applications are made unless a test says otherwise.
GIVETH A DATE
`the usual application day` MEANS YMD 2026 9 1

-- The commencement day of s 63(a)(1), supplied here as group G7 would (publication of the Law 14.1.2025 plus three months is
-- 14.4.2025; the s 59 regulations came into force 16.7.2025; the commencement day is the later).  An input, not a fact of this group.
GIVETH A DATE
`the commencement day in the tests` MEANS YMD 2025 7 16

GIVEN kind IS A `Licence kind`
      applicant IS AN Applicant
GIVETH AN Application
`an application on the usual day for a` kind `by` applicant MEANS
    `an application for a` kind `by` applicant `made on` `the usual application day`

§ `Fixtures — licences`

GIVEN kind IS A `Licence kind`
      temporary IS A BOOLEAN
      granted IS A DATE
      renewals IS A LIST OF DATE
      recorded IS A MAYBE DATE
      revoked IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the first day of a suspension` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the last day of a suspension` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A Licence
`a licence of kind` kind `, temporary being` temporary `, granted on` granted `, renewed on` renewals `, recorded to end` recorded `, revoked` revoked `, suspended from` `the first day of a suspension` `, suspended until` `the last day of a suspension` MEANS
    Licence WITH
        `the holder` IS `the test person`
        `the kind of licence` IS kind
        `a temporary licence under section 9` IS temporary
        `granted on` IS granted
        `renewed on` IS renewals
        `validity ends on, as recorded` IS recorded
        `revoked on` IS revoked
        `suspended from` IS `the first day of a suspension`
        `suspended until` IS `the last day of a suspension`

GIVEN kind IS A `Licence kind`
      granted IS A DATE
GIVETH A Licence
`an ordinary licence of kind` kind `granted on` granted MEANS
    `a licence of kind` kind `, temporary being` FALSE `, granted on` granted `, renewed on` EMPTY `, recorded to end` NOTHING `, revoked` NOTHING `, suspended from` NOTHING `, suspended until` NOTHING

GIVEN granted IS A DATE
GIVETH A Licence
`an ordinary grade 1 licence granted on` granted MEANS
    `an ordinary licence of kind` `grade 1 licence` `granted on` granted

§ `Fixtures — foreign experts`

GIVEN day IS A DATE
      similar IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Work done abroad by a foreign expert under section 9`
`a piece of work abroad on` day `, similar being` similar MEANS
    `Work done abroad by a foreign expert under section 9` WITH
        `the work` IS
            `Work item` WITH
                `performed by` IS `the test person`
                `the kind of job` IS `an installation job`
                `the system` IS `Cooling system` WITH
                    `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 100
                    `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
                `date performed` IS day
        `on a system similar to the systems the expert was invited to work on` IS similar

GIVEN capacity IS A NUMBER
      authorised IS A BOOLEAN
      foreign IS A BOOLEAN
      work IS A LIST OF `Work done abroad by a foreign expert under section 9`
GIVETH A `Foreign expert's application under section 9`
`a foreign expert invited for a system of` capacity `kW, authorised being` authorised `, from abroad being` foreign `, with work` work MEANS
    `Foreign expert's application under section 9` WITH
        `the application` IS `an application on the usual day for a` `grade 3 licence` `by` `an applicant with nothing`
        `the applicant comes from a foreign state` IS foreign
        `the system the expert was invited to work on` IS
            `Cooling system` WITH
                `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS capacity
                `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
        `authorised to do such work in a foreign state` IS authorised
        `work done abroad` IS work

GIVETH A `Foreign expert's application under section 9`
`a qualifying foreign expert` MEANS
    `a foreign expert invited for a system of` 100 `kW, authorised being` TRUE `, from abroad being` TRUE `, with work` (LIST (`a piece of work abroad on` (YMD 2024 5 1) `, similar being` TRUE))

GIVEN capacity IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Foreign expert's application under section 9`
`an expert qualifying in all but the capacity of the system, which is` capacity MEANS
    `a foreign expert invited for a system of` capacity `kW, authorised being` TRUE `, from abroad being` TRUE `, with work` (LIST (`a piece of work abroad on` (YMD 2024 5 1) `, similar being` TRUE))

GIVEN work IS A LIST OF `Work done abroad by a foreign expert under section 9`
GIVETH A `Foreign expert's application under section 9`
`an expert qualifying in all but the work, which is` work MEANS
    `a foreign expert invited for a system of` 100 `kW, authorised being` TRUE `, from abroad being` TRUE `, with work` work

GIVEN applicant IS AN Applicant
GIVETH A `Foreign expert's application under section 9`
`a foreign expert whose applicant is` applicant MEANS
    `Foreign expert's application under section 9` WITH
        `the application` IS `an application on the usual day for a` `grade 3 licence` `by` applicant
        `the applicant comes from a foreign state` IS TRUE
        `the system the expert was invited to work on` IS `Cooling system` WITH
            `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 100
            `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
        `authorised to do such work in a foreign state` IS TRUE
        `work done abroad` IS LIST (`a piece of work abroad on` (YMD 2024 5 1) `, similar being` TRUE)

-- Helpers for the tests of s 6(a).
GIVEN applicant IS AN Applicant
GIVETH AN Application
`an application on the usual day by` applicant MEANS
    `an application for a` `grade 1 licence` `by` applicant `made on` `the usual application day`

GIVEN application IS AN Application
      opinion IS A BOOLEAN
      completed IS A BOOLEAN
      approved IS A BOOLEAN
      recognised IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the s 6(a) conditions hold for` application `with opinion` opinion `, completion` completed `, approval` approved `and recognition` recognised MEANS
    `s 6(a) — the conditions (1) to (4) all hold` application `the commencement day in the tests` opinion completed approved recognised

GIVEN kind IS A `Licence kind`
      applicant IS AN Applicant
      opinion IS A BOOLEAN
      completed IS A BOOLEAN
      approved IS A BOOLEAN
      recognised IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the s 6(a) conditions hold for a` kind `by` applicant `with opinion` opinion `, completion` completed `, approval` approved `and recognition` recognised MEANS
    `the s 6(a) conditions hold for` (`an application for a` kind `by` applicant `made on` `the usual application day`) `with opinion` opinion `, completion` completed `, approval` approved `and recognition` recognised
